WEBVTT

01:30.870 --> 01:34.960
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.039 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 29]

01:38.200 --> 01:39.729
I'll just ask you one thing—

01:41.000 --> 01:42.400
they're not asking you to do

01:42.400 --> 01:43.950
something heinous, right?

01:46.840 --> 01:47.350
No.

01:48.200 --> 01:49.070
Then, do it!

01:50.759 --> 01:52.710
I was a soldier when I was young.

01:54.229 --> 01:56.030
When you're on the battlefield,

01:56.430 --> 01:59.200
turning back to run
only gets you killed faster.

01:59.280 --> 02:01.590
You're exposing your back to the enemy.

02:01.950 --> 02:03.400
The only way to survive

02:03.640 --> 02:05.000
is to charge forward!

02:08.690 --> 02:10.449
I, Chang Si, fear nothing.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.800
My daughter is well settled now.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.260
What do I have left to fear?

02:16.079 --> 02:16.810
Old Madam Gu,

02:17.430 --> 02:18.800
worrying won't help.

02:19.230 --> 02:20.270
I

02:21.079 --> 02:22.030
have traveled far and wide,

02:22.030 --> 02:22.840
and throughout my journey,

02:22.840 --> 02:24.240
I learned only one thing:

02:25.030 --> 02:27.960
there's always a way out
when you face difficulties.

02:30.000 --> 02:30.470
Come on,

02:30.960 --> 02:32.470
everyone, raise your glasses.

02:32.470 --> 02:33.630
Let's eat and drink our fill first.

02:33.630 --> 02:35.020
We'll deal with it when the time comes!

02:35.020 --> 02:35.870
Mr. Chang.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.570
You truly have a heroic spirit.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.630
I don't usually drink,

02:41.240 --> 02:42.970
but today I'll join you for one.

02:43.190 --> 02:45.390
Wishing our eldest son the best of luck.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.200
That's right.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.240
Come on.

02:53.210 --> 02:54.740
Even prisoners on death row

02:55.190 --> 02:56.710
get a last meal.

03:00.240 --> 03:00.970
Old Madam Gu,

03:01.280 --> 03:02.010
I apologize,

03:03.120 --> 03:04.080
but I'm going to start eating.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.140
Come on, let's eat.

03:09.430 --> 03:10.680
Aren't you hungry?

03:11.230 --> 03:12.490
Why aren't you eating?

03:13.190 --> 03:14.910
We're not married yet.

03:15.400 --> 03:16.520
I don't want to die.

03:23.240 --> 03:26.160
Let me sing a little tune for everyone.

03:26.280 --> 03:26.810
Alright!

03:27.630 --> 03:38.800
The lonely king grows drunk
in the Peach Blossom Palace.

03:39.240 --> 03:39.560
Bravo!

03:39.560 --> 03:50.310
Han Sumei was born with beauty.

03:50.110 --> 03:57.100
[Wedding]

03:59.079 --> 04:00.000
I didn't expect them to prepare all this

04:00.000 --> 04:00.870
with such care.

04:01.910 --> 04:03.400
They want you to risk your life for them—

04:03.400 --> 04:05.200
of course, they'd be attentive.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.640
My life already belongs to you.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.020
They can't have it.

04:12.430 --> 04:13.630
Such a smooth talker.

04:14.280 --> 04:16.430
As husband and wife,
we share the same fate.

04:16.430 --> 04:17.000
Even if I

04:17.000 --> 04:18.240
really offend them someday

04:18.240 --> 04:20.829
and they cut off my head—
even if I become a ghost—

04:20.829 --> 04:22.430
I'd still want to be with you.

04:26.120 --> 04:27.830
If this lifetime isn't enough,

04:27.830 --> 04:29.720
then I'll follow you into the next.

04:29.720 --> 04:36.990
♪ Rain falls along the silent corridor,
stirring a flood of memories ♪

04:35.920 --> 04:37.510
The whole family is counting on you

04:37.510 --> 04:38.680
to bring them home.

04:37.870 --> 04:44.240
♪ Listen as entwined destinies unfold,
line by line ♪

04:39.830 --> 04:40.950
We...

04:42.230 --> 04:44.830
still have a long,
long future ahead together.

04:45.260 --> 04:53.780
♪ I never wondered
how long my life would last ♪

04:49.510 --> 04:50.310
Wait a moment.

04:54.180 --> 05:01.020
♪ Only a trace of moonlight
lingers in my heart ♪

04:54.750 --> 05:00.790
[Wedding]

05:01.840 --> 05:09.120
♪ The wind brushes past the old eaves
on a cool night ♪

05:09.540 --> 05:16.440
♪ Look, the lanterns sway and cast shadow
of our overlapping silhouettes ♪

05:14.950 --> 05:16.680
Pacification Commissioner Gu of Liangjiang

05:16.680 --> 05:17.680
weds tonight!

05:17.070 --> 05:25.420
♪ Don't ask how long the journey
will take ♪

05:17.750 --> 05:19.270
All others, stay away!

05:20.000 --> 05:20.930
Those people...

05:21.250 --> 05:22.180
Those people...

05:22.630 --> 05:24.690
They have to let the whole world know.

05:26.270 --> 05:32.350
♪ I only hope that when we meet again,
you'll have fared well ♪

05:28.480 --> 05:30.540
-Congratulations to Mr. Gu
-Congratulations to Mr. Gu

05:30.540 --> 05:31.870
-and Madam Gu—
-and Madam Gu—

05:31.870 --> 05:33.450
-may you grow old together!
-may you grow old together!

05:33.100 --> 05:36.640
♪ Names being etched
and centered in the time ♪

05:33.680 --> 05:36.600
-May Mr. Gu have a prosperous career,
-May Mr. Gu have a prosperous career,

05:36.600 --> 05:39.600
-and Madam Gu stay forever young!
-and Madam Gu stay forever young!

05:37.140 --> 05:40.600
♪ A goose flying across the barren plains,
carrying the setting sun's last light ♪

05:41.100 --> 05:48.280
♪ The rain soaks the paper umbrella;
the red mark on my sleeve spreads ♪

05:46.310 --> 05:48.770
Going to all this trouble
for such nonsense.

05:48.950 --> 05:52.100
♪ My heart races so fast
like a surging sea ♪

05:52.800 --> 05:56.330
♪ Longing sweeps through like starlight ♪

05:56.909 --> 06:05.110
♪ Even when hair turns grey, we'll still
gaze at each other, fingers entwined ♪

06:05.510 --> 06:08.450
♪ The Milky Way spans the west window ♪

06:16.860 --> 06:18.550
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

06:19.910 --> 06:23.310
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office, Nanjing]

06:23.430 --> 06:30.900
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

06:28.600 --> 06:29.460
Please, Mr. Gu.

06:37.310 --> 06:40.560
His Excellency has arrived!

06:38.190 --> 06:39.470
[Righteous and Diligent]

06:41.070 --> 06:43.270
-Greetings, Your Excellency.
-Greetings, Your Excellency.

06:43.270 --> 06:44.670
Please, no formalities.

06:50.460 --> 06:53.150
[Rui Lin, Viceroy of Liangjiang]

06:51.920 --> 06:53.120
Is Mr. Gu here?

06:54.159 --> 06:55.360
This student is here.

06:57.950 --> 07:00.610
You call yourself a student,
not a subordinate?

07:01.120 --> 07:02.180
Why is that?

07:02.830 --> 07:04.090
Trying to cozy up to me?

07:04.920 --> 07:06.180
I'm merely a commoner.

07:06.680 --> 07:07.880
I dare not call myself

07:07.920 --> 07:09.310
Your Excellency's subordinate.

07:09.310 --> 07:11.040
But I've long heard that you're

07:11.270 --> 07:13.360
a senior scholar of the Hanlin Academy

07:13.360 --> 07:14.750
and a renowned master of Neo-Confucianism

07:14.750 --> 07:16.000
throughout the court.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.630
I may have been stripped of
my official title,

07:17.630 --> 07:20.120
but I've always considered myself
a scholar.

07:20.120 --> 07:20.780
Therefore,

07:21.000 --> 07:22.330
I call myself a student.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.910
Having no official title...

07:29.040 --> 07:30.570
is nothing to be ashamed of.

07:31.190 --> 07:32.680
Did Confucius or Mencius

07:32.870 --> 07:34.130
have official titles?

07:34.870 --> 07:37.000
I do appreciate what you said, though.

07:37.430 --> 07:37.870
Yes.

07:38.710 --> 07:40.110
Speaking of Neo-Confucianism,

07:40.040 --> 07:43.030
[Righteous and Diligent]

07:40.630 --> 07:41.330
it is truly

07:41.360 --> 07:43.120
a profound
and all-encompassing philosophy.

07:43.120 --> 07:43.750
Mencius said,

07:43.750 --> 07:46.800
"The difference between humans and beasts
is slight—

07:47.240 --> 07:51.390
it lies in preserving heavenly principles
and restraining human desires."

07:51.390 --> 07:52.590
The chaos in Jiangnan

07:52.800 --> 07:55.550
is precisely because Neo-Confucianism
has declined here.

07:55.550 --> 07:59.630
[Righteous and Diligent]

07:55.800 --> 07:57.560
Zeng Xiangxiang finished the war,

07:57.560 --> 07:58.390
dusted off his hands,

07:58.390 --> 07:59.870
and went to take up
an official position at court.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.470
Yet he left behind such a mess

08:01.560 --> 08:03.000
for me to clean up.

08:03.630 --> 08:05.430
Hundreds of thousands of troops

08:05.600 --> 08:07.860
are stationed in the Liangjiang region,

08:08.100 --> 08:10.680
demanding food and supplies from me.

08:12.070 --> 08:13.680
That's what I call beastly.

08:14.750 --> 08:15.750
Your Excellency.

08:16.310 --> 08:17.560
The silver we transported

08:17.560 --> 08:18.550
from the capital

08:19.040 --> 08:20.500
has been delivered today.

08:20.630 --> 08:22.630
Might I ask when the title deeds
for the salt fields

08:22.630 --> 08:24.130
and salt shops in Jiangnan

08:25.000 --> 08:26.400
can be transferred to us?

08:28.920 --> 08:30.040
Mencius said,

08:30.270 --> 08:31.870
"Why speak of profit?"

08:32.179 --> 08:33.440
See? See?

08:33.870 --> 08:35.299
Even Mencius said it.

08:35.669 --> 08:37.530
Stop fixating on that bit of salt.

08:37.909 --> 08:39.110
Wait a little longer.

08:39.710 --> 08:41.260
-Your Excellency.
-Your Excellency.

08:41.260 --> 08:42.840
Your subordinate has an idea.

08:42.840 --> 08:43.480
Those salt fields

08:43.480 --> 08:44.670
we fought bloody battles to reclaim

08:44.670 --> 08:45.790
could be partially distributed

08:45.790 --> 08:47.480
to the soldiers below to manage
as a reward.

08:47.480 --> 08:47.910
Otherwise,

08:47.910 --> 08:49.240
the soldiers will complain

08:49.240 --> 08:50.750
that what they risked their lives for

08:50.750 --> 08:51.720
is only enriching

08:51.720 --> 08:52.780
these profiteers,

08:52.790 --> 08:54.630
and they'll surely bear a grudge.

08:54.630 --> 08:55.390
Profiteers?

08:56.120 --> 08:57.080
You mean our family's title deeds

08:57.080 --> 08:58.590
were all stolen or seized?

09:00.000 --> 09:01.510
So many common people have died—

09:01.510 --> 09:02.390
who knows if your deeds

09:02.390 --> 09:03.390
are even genuine?

09:04.560 --> 09:06.440
It's just a handful of salt fields.

09:06.440 --> 09:08.300
Are they even enough to allocate?

09:08.480 --> 09:09.830
Who gets them and who doesn't?

09:09.830 --> 09:14.410
[Righteous and Diligent]

09:10.670 --> 09:11.870
Confucius once said,

09:12.030 --> 09:13.150
"The issue is not

09:13.420 --> 09:15.550
scarcity but unequal distribution."

09:15.840 --> 09:16.320
Your Excellency...

09:16.320 --> 09:17.840
Stop wasting my time with this nonsense.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.500
Stand down.

09:21.720 --> 09:23.120
Your Excellency, but...

09:23.270 --> 09:24.170
But what?

09:25.200 --> 09:26.790
The imperial court is watching
with wide eyes,

09:26.790 --> 09:28.520
hoping for the army to disband.

09:28.670 --> 09:29.550
And the army?

09:29.600 --> 09:30.510
Everyone in the army is watching eagerly,

09:30.510 --> 09:32.000
hoping to get paid soon

09:32.390 --> 09:33.450
so they can go home,

09:33.550 --> 09:35.760
buy houses and land, and find wives.

09:35.960 --> 09:38.090
Their eyes are red with anticipation.

09:38.440 --> 09:40.010
If you keep them here

09:40.120 --> 09:41.270
to run those salt fields,

09:41.270 --> 09:43.270
how are we supposed to disband them?

09:44.000 --> 09:45.080
What kind of idea is that?

09:45.080 --> 09:45.910
Stand down.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.510
After more than 10 years of war,

09:49.720 --> 09:54.620
[Righteous and Diligent]

09:51.080 --> 09:52.300
the army is poor,

09:52.600 --> 09:54.930
and the common people... are even poorer.

09:55.080 --> 09:55.670
I know

09:56.200 --> 09:57.080
you all

09:57.550 --> 09:59.700
don't want to mistreat

09:59.840 --> 10:01.670
your soldiers who fought so hard.

10:01.670 --> 10:03.800
You want to pay them as soon as possible

10:03.870 --> 10:07.000
so they can return home
to their sons and grandchildren.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.000
That's why

10:09.360 --> 10:11.540
I've invited young master Li Qin

10:11.600 --> 10:13.020
and Mr. Gu here—

10:13.270 --> 10:15.600
these young business elites—

10:15.670 --> 10:17.160
to give us some advice.

10:17.550 --> 10:19.340
Only when Nanjing prospers

10:19.440 --> 10:21.730
and the people have money in their pockets

10:21.730 --> 10:23.860
[Righteous and Diligent]

10:21.790 --> 10:23.630
can we collect taxes.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.490
That's the right approach.

10:26.960 --> 10:29.160
How could we take money from the people?

10:30.360 --> 10:30.960
Besides,

10:31.600 --> 10:34.100
Li Wantang, known as Li Million
from the capital,

10:34.100 --> 10:36.010
is a good friend of mine.

10:36.750 --> 10:39.000
He sent his son here to do business,

10:39.600 --> 10:40.730
buying salt fields.

10:41.030 --> 10:43.560
That's a blessing
for the Liangjiang region.

10:43.790 --> 10:44.960
From now on, none of you shall

10:44.960 --> 10:46.120
speak like this again

10:46.120 --> 10:47.750
and make things difficult for him.

10:47.750 --> 10:48.870
-Yes.
-Yes.

10:49.600 --> 10:51.000
Your Excellency is wise.

11:09.120 --> 11:10.120
Your Excellency.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.530
Please sit down.

11:16.320 --> 11:16.780
Come on.

11:17.120 --> 11:17.780
Have a seat.

11:20.270 --> 11:20.670
Sit.

11:23.720 --> 11:26.170
They say you're a remarkable figure.

11:27.000 --> 11:28.730
What insights can you offer me?

11:30.870 --> 11:32.330
I've heard bits and pieces

11:32.360 --> 11:34.480
about Your Excellency's difficulties.

11:34.480 --> 11:36.940
I wonder
what Your Excellency intends to do.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.330
Tell me first,

11:41.480 --> 11:43.210
what are your thoughts

11:43.480 --> 11:44.540
on doing business?

11:47.720 --> 11:49.270
I see business as...

11:50.440 --> 11:51.240
the Great Way.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.700
You're wrong, mister.

11:55.510 --> 11:56.840
Scholars, farmers, artisans, merchants—

11:56.840 --> 11:58.630
merchants stand at the bottom.

11:59.480 --> 12:00.600
Confucius said,

12:01.000 --> 12:03.000
"The small man comprehends profit,

12:03.670 --> 12:06.670
while the superior man
comprehends righteousness."

12:09.390 --> 12:10.850
Your Excellency is wrong.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.040
What did you just say?

12:14.870 --> 12:16.730
I said, Your Excellency is wrong.

12:18.240 --> 12:19.000
Business

12:19.840 --> 12:22.100
is nothing more than buying and selling.

12:22.200 --> 12:24.060
Back then, Confucius and Mencius

12:24.390 --> 12:26.600
traveled tirelessly throughout the world,

12:26.600 --> 12:27.800
and what was that for?

12:29.440 --> 12:31.270
Of course, it was

12:31.440 --> 12:33.350
to save all people under heaven

12:33.440 --> 12:34.870
and establish moral authority.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.670
Then how did they save the people

12:36.670 --> 12:38.080
and establish this moral authority?

12:38.080 --> 12:40.550
It was nothing more than persuading rulers
of various states

12:40.550 --> 12:42.610
and peddling their political ideas.

12:42.960 --> 12:45.240
Your Excellency yourself
used the word "peddling."

12:45.240 --> 12:46.970
Wasn't that already business?

12:48.080 --> 12:49.140
That's sophistry.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.770
Without trade,

12:51.960 --> 12:54.150
goods couldn't circulate
throughout the world,

12:54.150 --> 12:55.810
and people would still be born

12:56.270 --> 12:58.600
and die in the same place,
living in caves.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.550
Isn't business

12:59.550 --> 13:00.510
the Great Way?

13:02.750 --> 13:03.960
Strong ships and powerful cannons,

13:03.960 --> 13:05.270
the gains and losses of states,

13:05.270 --> 13:06.840
and the rise and fall of nations—

13:06.840 --> 13:07.900
all depend on this.

13:08.670 --> 13:09.510
So how can you say business

13:09.510 --> 13:10.510
isn't important?

13:14.000 --> 13:15.330
If you put it that way,

13:15.360 --> 13:16.120
I suppose...

13:17.670 --> 13:18.870
you have a point.

13:20.080 --> 13:21.250
In that case,

13:21.600 --> 13:22.720
businessmen

13:22.750 --> 13:24.080
are just like scholars,

13:24.080 --> 13:25.870
both seekers of the Way.

13:26.790 --> 13:28.390
There's no real difference.

13:28.670 --> 13:29.650
For scholars,

13:30.510 --> 13:32.200
seeking office is the lesser path,

13:32.200 --> 13:34.600
while saving the world is
the greater path.

13:35.000 --> 13:35.960
For merchants,

13:36.440 --> 13:38.440
pursuing wealth is the lesser path,

13:38.440 --> 13:40.790
while enriching the world is
the greater path.

13:40.790 --> 13:42.320
This student, though lacking in talent,

13:42.320 --> 13:43.030
has a heart

13:43.870 --> 13:46.070
that yearns to follow the greater path.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.820
Anyone can speak grand words.

13:49.270 --> 13:50.730
I've heard plenty of them.

13:51.840 --> 13:53.840
Tell me your true intentions first.

14:00.550 --> 14:02.510
When I first entered the business world,

14:02.510 --> 14:04.440
I thought everything in this world

14:04.720 --> 14:06.320
was merely a tool for profit.

14:07.550 --> 14:09.550
I believed that keeping one's word,

14:09.550 --> 14:10.840
following through on promises,

14:10.840 --> 14:12.000
and ensuring both parties benefit

14:12.000 --> 14:13.200
was the greater path.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.780
But merely "both parties"

14:16.440 --> 14:18.200
is too narrow.

14:18.750 --> 14:20.280
It's like two armies at war—

14:20.720 --> 14:22.000
those who care only about
winning a city or a fortress

14:22.000 --> 14:23.240
aren't true generals.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.040
Just as when I was a tea merchant—

14:25.320 --> 14:27.150
only after seeing the tea trade
across the province

14:27.150 --> 14:28.790
and even the entire nation

14:29.320 --> 14:30.360
did I know

14:30.390 --> 14:32.270
how I should pursue this path myself.

14:32.270 --> 14:34.330
Only then could I see the big picture.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.320
But now...

14:38.080 --> 14:39.320
now my thoughts

14:39.440 --> 14:40.770
have changed somewhat.

14:40.960 --> 14:41.760
I wonder,

14:42.270 --> 14:44.270
why limit oneself to one profession

14:44.440 --> 14:46.100
or focus on just one business?

14:47.510 --> 14:49.040
Since arriving in Nanjing,

14:49.270 --> 14:50.480
I've witnessed devastation everywhere

14:50.480 --> 14:52.000
and people struggling to survive.

14:52.000 --> 14:52.870
And I think

14:53.790 --> 14:55.850
this is a good business opportunity.

14:56.960 --> 14:57.790
If possible,

14:58.670 --> 15:00.630
I would like to assist Your Excellency

15:00.630 --> 15:01.830
in managing Jiangnan

15:02.510 --> 15:04.110
and planning for the nation.

15:11.550 --> 15:12.720
Audacious young man,

15:12.720 --> 15:14.780
you truly are an audacious young man.

15:14.870 --> 15:16.560
Even I wouldn't dare

15:16.600 --> 15:18.930
speak so boldly about managing Jiangnan.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.840
However, such ambition

15:20.840 --> 15:22.170
is indeed commendable.

15:23.630 --> 15:25.770
Don't just be someone

15:26.320 --> 15:27.430
who talks.

15:28.390 --> 15:30.240
I must see actual results.

15:32.550 --> 15:33.680
If you want results,

15:34.440 --> 15:37.440
Your Excellency will need to
follow my instructions.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.770
Follow your instructions?

15:44.080 --> 15:44.870
Young man,

15:45.670 --> 15:48.520
that's quite a bold request.

15:49.720 --> 15:50.720
I came to Jiangnan

15:51.080 --> 15:52.610
not for wealth or position.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.200
Your Excellency has brought

15:55.200 --> 15:57.130
my entire family here as hostages.

15:57.960 --> 15:58.570
I only ask

15:58.600 --> 16:00.260
that they return home safely.

16:01.750 --> 16:02.670
You really

16:03.240 --> 16:04.960
don't want money or position?

16:06.270 --> 16:08.530
What use are position and wealth anyway?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.480
I only fear that one day,

16:09.480 --> 16:11.550
your forces will fall into chaos again,

16:11.550 --> 16:13.960
the people of Jiangnan
will suffer terribly,

16:13.960 --> 16:16.320
and my hometown will be destroyed
once more—

16:16.320 --> 16:18.360
then there will truly be no hope left.

16:18.360 --> 16:20.290
Neither the country nor the people

16:20.320 --> 16:21.850
can bear such devastation.

16:22.600 --> 16:23.600
In times of chaos,

16:24.390 --> 16:24.850
what use

16:25.360 --> 16:26.090
are position

16:26.750 --> 16:27.630
or wealth?

16:29.360 --> 16:29.960
Very well.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.000
I'll trust you this once.

16:33.840 --> 16:35.320
As long as I can

16:35.440 --> 16:36.600
truly manage Jiangnan

16:36.600 --> 16:37.840
as you say

16:38.200 --> 16:39.600
and restore production,

16:40.360 --> 16:41.690
I don't mind

16:41.790 --> 16:42.990
following your lead.

16:46.270 --> 16:50.790
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

16:48.960 --> 16:49.760
Hurry, hurry!

16:50.030 --> 16:50.870
Prepare the palanquins!

16:50.870 --> 16:52.720
His Excellency and Lord Gu are going out!

16:52.720 --> 16:57.990
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

16:52.780 --> 16:53.790
Are they going to the camp?

16:53.790 --> 16:54.960
Who told you that?

16:55.200 --> 16:55.840
Don't ask questions!

16:55.840 --> 16:56.970
Just follow orders.

17:01.830 --> 17:04.710
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

17:07.000 --> 17:11.550
His Excellency is going to
the Qinhuai River with Mr. Gu...

17:14.510 --> 17:16.250
On official duty!

17:19.619 --> 17:22.150
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

17:21.200 --> 17:23.329
-Your Excellency!
-Your Excellency!

17:27.480 --> 17:28.060
Go back.

17:28.160 --> 17:28.820
Go back now.

17:29.800 --> 17:31.240
I don't need you to follow us.

17:31.240 --> 17:31.720
Go back!

17:33.400 --> 17:33.930
Let's go.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.400
What should we...

17:38.790 --> 17:39.270
Well...

17:39.790 --> 17:40.590
Let's go back.

17:59.990 --> 18:02.400
[Su's Flower Shop]

18:01.510 --> 18:02.000
Stop.

18:10.860 --> 18:11.530
Well,

18:12.270 --> 18:13.460
M-Mr. Gu,

18:14.200 --> 18:15.300
well...

18:15.440 --> 18:16.920
What is it, Your Excellency?

18:16.920 --> 18:18.480
Don't call me "Your Excellency" here.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.510
If you keep calling me that,

18:19.510 --> 18:20.570
before nightfall,

18:20.590 --> 18:22.510
the entire city of Nanjing will know

18:22.510 --> 18:24.370
that I visited the Qinhuai River.

18:24.510 --> 18:27.510
It's a disgrace to my scholarship
and my position.

18:27.920 --> 18:28.870
I'm

18:29.000 --> 18:30.790
a scholar of Neo-Confucianism.

18:30.790 --> 18:32.530
Are you trying to ruin me?

18:41.350 --> 18:42.220
So many of them.

18:42.790 --> 18:43.920
All of these are that kind of place?

18:43.920 --> 18:45.320
Which one shall we visit?

18:46.270 --> 18:47.270
Are you asking me?

18:47.400 --> 18:49.200
You think I've been here before?

18:49.440 --> 18:51.160
I study Neo-Confucianism,

18:51.200 --> 18:53.860
which emphasizes
"don't look at impropriety."

18:54.400 --> 18:55.360
This one then.

18:57.270 --> 18:58.030
No,

18:58.440 --> 19:00.610
the girls there are quite dull.

19:00.640 --> 19:01.680
No, no, no.

19:02.830 --> 19:03.790
Then you decide.

19:10.680 --> 19:11.210
This one.

19:11.510 --> 19:12.040
This one.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.000
That one.

19:13.070 --> 19:14.200
Go knock on the door.

19:25.210 --> 19:27.190
[Yicui House]

19:26.480 --> 19:27.680
Coming, coming.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.430
[Yicui House]

19:32.030 --> 19:34.030
Are you a regular or a new patron?

19:34.200 --> 19:36.260
How would you like to enjoy yourself?

19:37.090 --> 19:39.410
[Yicui House]

19:41.100 --> 19:42.560
I know nothing about this.

19:42.920 --> 19:44.250
I don't know what to ask.

19:44.550 --> 19:46.060
I don't know either.

19:46.200 --> 19:47.130
How would I know?

19:47.160 --> 19:48.440
I follow "don't look at impropriety,"
remember?

19:48.440 --> 19:49.680
Well, if that's the case,

19:49.680 --> 19:50.200
perfect.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.510
I haven't even unpacked yet.

19:51.510 --> 19:53.960
I'll just take my luggage
and go back to Anhui.

19:53.960 --> 19:54.490
You brat,

19:55.310 --> 19:57.170
you're ruining me, you know that?

19:58.750 --> 19:59.550
Let me ask you—

20:00.750 --> 20:02.160
can we really make money from this?

20:02.160 --> 20:03.960
If we can't, you can take my head.

20:04.350 --> 20:05.480
Right now, hundreds of thousands of troops

20:05.480 --> 20:06.440
are waiting for their pay

20:06.440 --> 20:06.830
as if

20:06.830 --> 20:08.430
sitting on pins and needles.

20:08.550 --> 20:09.510
This isn't helping me—

20:09.510 --> 20:10.960
it's helping you.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.200
Fine!

20:19.480 --> 20:19.940
Come on!

20:20.240 --> 20:21.510
We want girls! Hurry up!

20:21.510 --> 20:22.510
Call them all out.

20:22.550 --> 20:23.680
I want a tea party.

20:24.400 --> 20:26.490
Two taels of silver for each girl,

20:26.640 --> 20:28.350
seven candareens for the maids,

20:28.350 --> 20:30.280
and five candareens for the pimps.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.310
Start me off with
four dried and four fresh dishes

20:32.310 --> 20:33.350
and eight fruit platters.

20:33.350 --> 20:33.920
Oh, and

20:34.200 --> 20:35.200
have the girls pick

20:35.200 --> 20:36.660
their best songs to sing.

20:37.070 --> 20:37.600
Hurry up!

20:37.960 --> 20:38.680
Yes, sir!

20:38.920 --> 20:39.390
Come on,

20:39.510 --> 20:41.060
everyone, tidy up quickly!

20:41.200 --> 20:42.250
Quickly, move it!

20:42.350 --> 20:43.960
A big spender is here!

20:44.000 --> 20:44.510
Coming!

20:44.720 --> 20:45.200
Hurry!

20:45.240 --> 20:46.350
-Coming!
-Coming!

20:46.440 --> 20:47.550
How do we ask for girls?

20:47.550 --> 20:48.610
-Coming!
-Coming!

20:50.160 --> 20:51.030
I don't know.

20:53.000 --> 20:53.860
You don't know?

20:53.920 --> 20:55.450
You must be in the business.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.110
Do you have any girls from Lizhou?

21:01.270 --> 21:03.000
You're quite the connoisseur, sir.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.480
I wouldn't dare lie to you, sir.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.420
We have two.

21:05.720 --> 21:07.320
If I were a few years younger,

21:07.830 --> 21:08.670
I'd want to

21:08.880 --> 21:10.410
serve you properly myself.

21:12.880 --> 21:13.880
Go. Away with you!

21:14.270 --> 21:14.920
Yes, sir!

21:15.030 --> 21:16.230
Please wait a moment!

21:23.270 --> 21:24.350
Master of Neo-Confucianism—

21:24.350 --> 21:26.410
you truly live up to your reputation.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.160
I must have

21:30.310 --> 21:31.390
lost my mind,

21:31.880 --> 21:33.810
coming out to fool around with you.

21:34.160 --> 21:36.070
My lifelong reputation...

21:37.000 --> 21:37.800
Mark my words,

21:38.240 --> 21:41.170
sooner or later, this will reach
the Emperor's ears.

21:45.030 --> 21:46.500
Here come the girls!

21:47.110 --> 21:48.310
Sorry to keep you waiting, gentlemen.

21:48.310 --> 21:49.370
Quickly, quickly.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.570
Show the guests some hospitality!

21:51.790 --> 21:52.720
Sir, please have some tea.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.590
Okay, okay.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.310
They say the "Eight Beauties of Qinhuai"

21:55.310 --> 21:57.000
are like fairies beyond the mortal world.

21:57.000 --> 21:57.790
Yet here you are—

21:57.790 --> 21:59.350
like someone risen from the mud.

21:59.350 --> 22:00.010
-Sir.
-Sir.

22:00.440 --> 22:01.970
If you had come 10 years ago,

22:02.000 --> 22:03.640
we would've dazzled your eyes.

22:03.640 --> 22:04.550
But nowadays,

22:05.110 --> 22:06.830
it's really not what it used to be.

22:06.830 --> 22:07.890
Then let me ask you,

22:08.030 --> 22:10.560
can we still take a ride
on a pleasure boat now?

22:11.070 --> 22:12.240
Pleasure boat...

22:12.640 --> 22:13.700
You can take a ride,

22:14.070 --> 22:16.370
but... they're terribly old

22:16.550 --> 22:17.750
and extremely dirty.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.000
Go clean one up.

22:20.510 --> 22:21.920
Since we're already here today,

22:21.920 --> 22:23.250
we must take a boat ride.

22:23.680 --> 22:25.200
Don't underestimate this gentleman here.

22:25.200 --> 22:26.730
Liangjiang is under his...

22:28.400 --> 22:29.600
My friend, my friend,

22:29.880 --> 22:30.790
with the little money we have,

22:30.790 --> 22:33.120
let's not pretend we're rich around here.

22:33.590 --> 22:35.720
If you want to ride on a pleasure boat,
then do it.

22:35.720 --> 22:37.250
Why bring up that nonsense?

22:38.480 --> 22:39.400
Hurry up, hurry up!

22:39.400 --> 22:40.510
Go prepare the boat!

22:40.510 --> 22:41.370
Yes, sir!

22:41.480 --> 22:42.810
Girls, serve them well!

22:42.830 --> 22:46.030
-Start singing!
-I'll kill you if you bring that up again!

22:46.790 --> 22:48.190
Come on, sir, have a seat.

22:49.240 --> 22:54.920
A straight purple bamboo rising tall…

22:54.920 --> 22:56.830
Just drinking like this is boring.

22:56.830 --> 22:57.400
I can't anymore,

22:57.400 --> 22:58.160
I can't drink anymore.

22:58.160 --> 22:59.520
I absolutely can't.

23:00.590 --> 23:01.440
Alright, alright.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.030
I can't drink anymore.

23:02.030 --> 23:02.960
Really, I can't drink anymore.

23:02.960 --> 23:03.480
I can't drink anymore.

23:03.480 --> 23:04.440
It's all covered in dirt.

23:04.440 --> 23:05.440
It tastes earthy.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.030
What is all this stuff...

23:07.030 --> 23:08.360
Come on, keep drinking!

23:08.680 --> 23:09.640
Well, my friend,

23:09.720 --> 23:10.480
my good friend,

23:10.480 --> 23:12.160
aren't you going to help me out?

23:12.160 --> 23:13.110
So heartless?

23:13.750 --> 23:14.720
I've already drunk

23:14.720 --> 23:15.880
nearly two jin, right?

23:15.880 --> 23:16.830
You said to come here for fun,

23:16.830 --> 23:18.110
but you're not even participating.

23:18.110 --> 23:19.770
You deserve a penalty. Drink.

23:19.790 --> 23:20.350
No, no!

23:20.830 --> 23:22.240
You, you brat!

23:24.160 --> 23:25.220
He really drank it!

23:27.160 --> 23:27.830
Look at you.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.880
Don't catch a cold.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.640
Fill it up again.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.160
Fill it.

23:30.720 --> 23:31.450
Another cup.

23:31.480 --> 23:32.150
Alright.

23:32.150 --> 23:33.160
Another cup. Come on.

23:33.160 --> 23:33.720
Miss.

23:36.440 --> 23:36.970
Sit down.

23:41.350 --> 23:43.150
-Sir, let me fill your cup!
-Sir!

23:44.310 --> 23:45.070
One more, one more.

23:45.070 --> 23:45.750
Alright, Alright.

23:45.750 --> 23:46.400
-One more cup, one more.
-Alright.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.460
You sing very well.

23:47.830 --> 23:48.690
Who taught you?

23:49.030 --> 23:49.850
Sir,

23:50.240 --> 23:51.370
my mother taught me.

23:51.510 --> 23:52.710
Where is your mother?

23:54.350 --> 23:55.240
My mother...

23:55.830 --> 23:57.750
passed away this spring.

23:59.240 --> 24:00.850
I had no money for her burial,

24:01.160 --> 24:02.830
so I could only store her coffin

24:02.830 --> 24:04.130
at a temple.

24:04.590 --> 24:06.070
When I earn enough money,

24:06.200 --> 24:07.860
I'll give her a proper burial.

24:08.030 --> 24:09.240
Your mother...

24:09.920 --> 24:10.920
What was her name?

24:12.350 --> 24:14.080
She was called the Grande Dame.

24:14.440 --> 24:15.300
"Grande Dame?"

24:15.680 --> 24:17.350
Someone actually had that name?

24:17.350 --> 24:19.350
You're young, so you wouldn't know.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.270
This Grande Dame—if we're

24:20.270 --> 24:21.030
talking about 10 years ago—

24:21.030 --> 24:22.200
oh my, she was extraordinary.

24:22.200 --> 24:23.920
You could spend hundreds of taels

24:23.920 --> 24:26.250
and still might not
catch a glimpse of her.

24:28.310 --> 24:29.370
A peerless beauty.

24:29.720 --> 24:30.480
What a pity.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.170
Indeed.

24:31.310 --> 24:32.240
Well, Your Ex...

24:33.160 --> 24:33.680
You!

24:36.310 --> 24:37.550
I just heard

24:37.550 --> 24:38.950
that this singing girl's

24:39.110 --> 24:39.790
mother

24:40.070 --> 24:41.400
went by the Grande Dame.

24:41.550 --> 24:43.920
She was the top courtesan here
10 years ago.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.720
Rich men spent hundreds of taels

24:45.750 --> 24:48.150
and still might not get to
see her even once.

24:49.030 --> 24:50.110
I don't have that much money.

24:50.110 --> 24:51.790
Even with money, you can't see her now.

24:51.790 --> 24:52.720
She's dead.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.830
It happened this spring.

24:53.830 --> 24:54.720
Dead?

24:55.270 --> 24:56.830
Why tell me about someone who's dead?

24:56.830 --> 24:57.960
Seriously... Come on.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.640
Her coffin is still at a temple.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.720
The daughter has no money for the burial.

25:00.720 --> 25:02.480
Why don't you show some kindness

25:02.480 --> 25:03.280
and pay for it?

25:04.200 --> 25:06.550
-Yes, sir!
-You have a kind heart.

25:09.880 --> 25:10.830
You're right.

25:10.880 --> 25:11.880
I'll do as you say.

25:12.960 --> 25:13.880
Since that's the case,

25:13.880 --> 25:15.070
why not go all the way

25:15.790 --> 25:17.240
and write an elegiac couplet for her?

25:17.240 --> 25:18.240
What do you think?

25:19.110 --> 25:20.310
I can't compose one.

25:21.350 --> 25:23.210
Thank you, Master, for your generous help

25:23.210 --> 25:24.410
in burying my mother.

25:24.480 --> 25:26.070
May your nobility last
for all generations,

25:26.070 --> 25:27.200
and your fortune and longevity
be boundless.

25:27.200 --> 25:27.720
Yes.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.720
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, sir.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.160
My friend...

25:30.160 --> 25:31.350
Let me discuss it with my friend.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.110
Come on, let's talk over there.

25:32.110 --> 25:33.270
Prepare paper and ink!

25:33.270 --> 25:34.200
Right away!

25:34.790 --> 25:35.550
Move the dishes, move them.

25:35.550 --> 25:37.010
Can we discuss this first?

25:37.450 --> 25:38.410
I'm...

25:38.640 --> 25:39.640
Don't disturb me.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.540
I'm composing the elegiac lines.

25:42.270 --> 25:44.420
Can we think about it after we go back?

25:44.640 --> 25:45.900
Think about it at home?

25:46.750 --> 25:47.510
Have you forgotten

25:47.510 --> 25:48.770
what you said earlier?

25:53.200 --> 25:53.720
Fine!

25:54.200 --> 25:54.720
Come on!

25:57.590 --> 25:58.070
Come on.

25:59.030 --> 26:00.160
For the Grande Dame,

26:00.480 --> 26:01.790
the first line is,

26:02.160 --> 26:05.270
"Life, however grand,
is but a fleeting dream."

26:06.830 --> 26:07.440
And

26:07.680 --> 26:09.090
for the second line,

26:09.240 --> 26:11.720
"Let the dame's soul now rest in peace."

26:13.200 --> 26:14.070
Good.

26:15.000 --> 26:15.960
Very good.

26:16.110 --> 26:16.640
Come on.

26:17.640 --> 26:23.790
[Life]

26:22.310 --> 26:23.510
Paying for the burial

26:24.920 --> 26:26.720
and writing an elegiac couplet—

26:26.750 --> 26:29.270
this is kindness to the deceased,

26:29.550 --> 26:31.610
a great deed that accumulates merit.

26:34.550 --> 26:35.560
My good sir,

26:34.660 --> 26:37.300
[Dame]

26:35.920 --> 26:37.200
you've got

26:37.350 --> 26:39.100
such a brilliant mind!

26:39.160 --> 26:39.830
You can even

26:39.880 --> 26:40.950
read my mind?

26:41.110 --> 26:41.880
Good.

26:45.460 --> 26:47.300
[Rest in Peace]

26:48.030 --> 26:48.640
My friend,

26:48.660 --> 26:50.060
excellent calligraphy!

26:50.310 --> 26:51.550
This style of writing
and the elegiac couplet you composed

26:51.150 --> 26:53.740
[Life, however grand,
is but a fleeting dream]

26:51.590 --> 26:52.920
go perfectly together!

26:53.740 --> 26:56.340
[Let the dame's soul now rest in peace]

26:54.310 --> 26:56.510
However, there's just one small issue.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.440
What's wrong with it?

26:58.440 --> 26:59.900
You haven't signed it yet.

27:07.830 --> 27:09.000
How should I sign it?

27:09.440 --> 27:10.630
Write your name.

27:10.750 --> 27:11.240
No way.

27:11.790 --> 27:12.960
Have you forgotten what I said?

27:12.960 --> 27:13.420
What...

27:13.440 --> 27:14.370
What did you say?

27:14.590 --> 27:16.250
You must follow all my orders.

27:16.870 --> 27:18.640
You need money to disband the troops.

27:18.640 --> 27:20.700
The money. Don't you want it anymore?

27:22.000 --> 27:23.160
Then I'll write your name,

27:23.160 --> 27:23.590
okay?

27:23.590 --> 27:24.640
I'm begging you.

27:25.000 --> 27:25.920
Write my name?

27:25.960 --> 27:27.750
Why would I have brought you here then?

27:27.750 --> 27:29.000
Only with your signature,

27:29.000 --> 27:30.330
your name,

27:30.750 --> 27:32.880
will this elegiac couplet have value.

27:33.240 --> 27:33.920
It has value, you say?

27:33.920 --> 27:34.920
Of course it does.

27:36.030 --> 27:37.360
Give me another reason.

27:38.920 --> 27:40.000
On the way here,

27:40.000 --> 27:41.530
I spoke with many officers.

27:41.590 --> 27:42.830
They've been fighting for over a decade,

27:42.830 --> 27:44.200
and they're restless,
with eyes red and burning,

27:44.200 --> 27:45.790
ready to riot and rebel.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.830
If they storm into

27:47.830 --> 27:49.110
your office

27:49.270 --> 27:50.880
with guns and swords pointed at you,

27:50.880 --> 27:51.740
at that moment,

27:51.750 --> 27:52.920
neither Confucius nor Mencius

27:52.920 --> 27:54.450
will be able to protect you.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.400
Even a steel neck won't help you then.

27:56.400 --> 27:57.200
Shut up!

28:01.440 --> 28:01.900
Come on.

28:08.400 --> 28:12.870
[Rui]

28:21.740 --> 28:26.100
[Rui Lin]

28:28.070 --> 28:28.600
Alright!

28:29.200 --> 28:30.510
Lay the plank and make for shore!

28:30.510 --> 28:31.310
Let's go back!

28:33.110 --> 28:34.310
These characters...

28:34.960 --> 28:35.400
What do these say?

28:35.400 --> 28:36.790
Rui Lin.

28:38.240 --> 28:38.720
Well...

28:40.640 --> 28:43.500
Thank you, Your Excellency,
for your calligraphy!

28:46.030 --> 28:48.190
There's no heavenly principle here.

28:50.510 --> 28:51.310
Let's go back!

29:02.510 --> 29:05.710
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

29:07.110 --> 29:08.240
The Viceroy and Lord Gu

29:08.240 --> 29:09.790
went to the Qinhuai River yesterday.

29:09.790 --> 29:11.350
It's written in black and white.

29:11.350 --> 29:12.710
They can't deny it.

29:12.790 --> 29:13.520
Everyone...

29:13.680 --> 29:14.480
Yesterday...

29:21.270 --> 29:22.500
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

29:21.640 --> 29:22.110
Gu.

29:22.960 --> 29:23.890
Come on, come on.

29:24.000 --> 29:24.600
Come here.

29:25.620 --> 29:28.340
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

29:31.640 --> 29:32.570
Where did you go?

29:32.960 --> 29:33.650
Nowhere.

29:33.790 --> 29:35.450
I just came to report for duty.

29:36.630 --> 29:37.410
They said

29:37.720 --> 29:39.880
you went to the Qinhuai River last night

29:39.880 --> 29:41.640
with the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.440
Is that true?

29:42.510 --> 29:43.030
It is.

29:44.590 --> 29:46.650
I didn't know you had such interests.

29:46.750 --> 29:48.000
Food and sex are human nature.

29:48.000 --> 29:49.130
What's the big deal?

29:51.480 --> 29:52.480
So it's true then.

29:53.510 --> 29:54.510
Truth is truth.

29:56.570 --> 29:59.760
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

29:57.960 --> 30:00.070
His Excellency is not feeling well today!

30:00.070 --> 30:01.030
If anyone has business,

30:01.030 --> 30:02.400
please submit a written report!

30:02.400 --> 30:02.920
Also...

30:04.110 --> 30:05.640
Mr. Gu, please come with me.

30:05.790 --> 30:07.790
His Excellency specifically asked
to see you.

30:07.790 --> 30:08.200
Yes.

30:11.070 --> 30:11.680
Lord Gu...

30:18.830 --> 30:19.830
Your Excellency.

30:20.880 --> 30:21.350
You...

30:21.510 --> 30:23.720
Y-You're going to be the death of me.

30:24.310 --> 30:26.140
I've already convinced myself

30:26.200 --> 30:28.060
hundreds of times not to kill you.

30:28.480 --> 30:30.340
Are you deliberately coming here

30:30.420 --> 30:32.020
to d-drag me through the mud?

30:33.510 --> 30:34.800
I didn't want to come.

30:35.030 --> 30:36.230
You forced me to come.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.550
I must have lost my mind.

30:43.270 --> 30:44.550
No, I just...

30:46.960 --> 30:47.920
What's wrong?

30:48.350 --> 30:49.240
"What's wrong?"

30:49.240 --> 30:50.770
You have the nerve to ask me?

30:53.000 --> 30:54.310
Shouldn't you

30:54.310 --> 30:55.510
explain yourself to me?

30:55.510 --> 30:56.640
What am I supposed to explain?

30:56.640 --> 30:57.300
Explain...

30:58.240 --> 30:58.970
Tell me,

30:59.000 --> 31:00.860
what exactly are you trying to do?

31:01.640 --> 31:03.840
A-And where's the money you mentioned?

31:05.830 --> 31:07.640
Well, Your Excellency is well-read.

31:07.640 --> 31:08.510
Don't you know

31:08.510 --> 31:09.550
which patron saint is

31:09.550 --> 31:11.350
worshiped in all the brothels
in the country?

31:11.350 --> 31:12.480
Well, isn't that...

31:14.880 --> 31:17.100
The classics even mention this?

31:17.720 --> 31:18.720
It actually is.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.590
Confucius, in his lifetime,

31:20.590 --> 31:21.920
praised very few people.

31:21.920 --> 31:23.880
Among them was the Prime Minister of Qi,

31:23.880 --> 31:25.740
Guan Zhong, also known as Guanzi.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.590
Stop showing off.

31:27.880 --> 31:28.610
Just tell me.

31:28.720 --> 31:30.680
Back then, Qi was remote
and sparsely populated,

31:30.680 --> 31:32.680
so Guan Zhong established
a women's quarter.

31:32.680 --> 31:33.680
That women's quarter

31:33.680 --> 31:36.270
was just like what we have now
at the Qinhuai River.

31:36.270 --> 31:37.030
And the result?

31:37.030 --> 31:38.160
Within three years,

31:38.200 --> 31:39.480
the capital, Linzi, became prosperous,

31:39.480 --> 31:41.410
with crowds of people everywhere.

31:43.240 --> 31:45.720
I know Your Excellency is
a master of Neo-Confucianism.

31:45.720 --> 31:46.720
You uphold the principle,
"Preserve heavenly principles

31:46.720 --> 31:47.680
and suppress human desires."

31:47.680 --> 31:49.000
But in matters under heaven,

31:49.000 --> 31:50.680
if you go against human desires,

31:50.680 --> 31:52.310
you can't accomplish anything.

31:52.310 --> 31:54.390
The Qinhuai River has always been

31:54.440 --> 31:57.440
a place where scholars
and refined gentlemen linger.

31:57.440 --> 31:59.110
So I'd like to ask Your Excellency

31:59.110 --> 32:00.110
to allocate

32:00.160 --> 32:01.750
100,000 taels from the treasury.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.400
First,

32:02.830 --> 32:04.810
to dredge the Qinhuai River.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.960
Second, to provide interest-free loans

32:06.960 --> 32:08.030
to those brothels

32:08.750 --> 32:09.860
so the girls there

32:09.920 --> 32:12.110
can buy more hairpins and jewelry,

32:12.160 --> 32:12.920
fabrics,

32:13.400 --> 32:14.860
fine food, and tea snacks.

32:14.920 --> 32:16.270
Then we need to spread

32:16.310 --> 32:17.370
this news quickly.

32:17.550 --> 32:19.550
Once word spreads
among merchants and travelers,

32:19.550 --> 32:20.880
they'll come in droves.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.310
With more people coming,

32:22.310 --> 32:23.310
more business being done,

32:23.310 --> 32:24.570
and more circulation,

32:24.750 --> 32:26.950
won't the tax revenue increase as well?

32:27.070 --> 32:28.440
By then, Your Excellency,

32:28.440 --> 32:30.070
you won't have to worry about
collecting money.

32:30.070 --> 32:31.440
What nonsense is that?

32:33.160 --> 32:35.290
Using government funds

32:35.550 --> 32:38.030
to lend to those houses of pleasure?

32:38.240 --> 32:40.320
If those censors find out about this

32:40.350 --> 32:41.270
and submit memorials against me,

32:41.270 --> 32:42.530
what will become of me?

32:43.350 --> 32:44.480
Those memorials would merely

32:44.480 --> 32:46.850
accuse you of indulging in wine and women.

32:47.830 --> 32:50.690
Isn't that preferable to
having chaos everywhere?

32:53.160 --> 32:54.880
That's one way to look at it.

32:56.110 --> 32:57.350
But all the officials

32:57.350 --> 32:58.270
are watching.

32:58.720 --> 33:01.580
How can I,
a respected master of Neo-Confucianism,

33:01.590 --> 33:02.990
act out of line like this?

33:04.440 --> 33:05.750
Tell me clearly

33:05.790 --> 33:07.450
what you're really planning.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.830
We haven't earned a single coin,

33:08.830 --> 33:10.270
and now you want 100,000 taels?

33:10.270 --> 33:10.880
No way.

33:11.640 --> 33:12.790
Gaozi once said,

33:13.160 --> 33:14.960
"Food and sex are human nature."

33:15.030 --> 33:16.290
All people in the world

33:16.590 --> 33:19.000
care about nothing
but food and sexual desires.

33:19.000 --> 33:19.870
I believe

33:20.000 --> 33:22.440
that once we revive the pleasure quarters
along the Qinhuai River,

33:22.440 --> 33:23.440
within a year,

33:23.830 --> 33:25.160
the vitality of Nanjing

33:25.200 --> 33:26.600
will gradually recover.

33:27.110 --> 33:28.090
Ridiculous.

33:28.790 --> 33:30.640
Restoring vitality through those women?

33:30.640 --> 33:31.500
What else then?

33:32.550 --> 33:34.410
Renovating the examination hall

33:34.510 --> 33:36.200
and printing a few Confucian classics?

33:36.200 --> 33:37.730
Will that revive anything?

33:38.510 --> 33:39.600
Your Excellency,

33:39.750 --> 33:41.070
we agreed from the beginning

33:41.070 --> 33:42.730
to manage Jiangnan together.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.450
If so, we must adopt

33:44.480 --> 33:45.880
a business perspective.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.030
Business is

33:47.270 --> 33:49.240
nothing more than
the outflow and inflow of money.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.980
If you truly agree to this,

33:51.270 --> 33:53.190
you'll demonstrate to the whole world

33:53.190 --> 33:54.200
your determination

33:54.200 --> 33:56.270
to restore normal life here.

33:57.510 --> 33:58.880
First, revitalize the market

33:58.880 --> 34:00.400
and fill everyone's stomachs.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.510
The investment is small,

34:01.510 --> 34:02.970
but the returns are great.

34:03.480 --> 34:06.010
One hundred thousand taels
will be effective

34:06.070 --> 34:07.920
and will also make a statement.

34:08.230 --> 34:09.110
Your Excellency,

34:09.110 --> 34:10.909
don't you think it's a good deal?

34:11.070 --> 34:11.710
Really?

34:13.190 --> 34:14.400
Speaking of which,

34:14.440 --> 34:15.790
when I visited

34:15.920 --> 34:17.320
some brothels
with Your Excellency yesterday,

34:17.320 --> 34:19.260
it truly opened my eyes.

34:19.590 --> 34:21.550
Can Your Excellency teach this student

34:21.550 --> 34:23.280
some of those terms and jargon?

34:23.710 --> 34:24.550
Enough, enough.

34:24.550 --> 34:26.469
Let's not discuss this topic anymore.

34:26.469 --> 34:28.260
Fine, I'll approve this money.

34:28.920 --> 34:30.480
Your Excellency has
the heart of a Bodhisattva.

34:30.480 --> 34:31.400
Since that's the case,

34:31.400 --> 34:34.530
I'd like to ask Your Excellency
to allocate another sum.

34:35.030 --> 34:36.560
Isn't that enough already?

34:36.800 --> 34:37.510
People will say

34:37.510 --> 34:38.920
I came to Nanjing as an official

34:38.920 --> 34:40.280
only to spend all the money

34:40.280 --> 34:41.710
on businesses along the Qinhuai River—

34:41.710 --> 34:43.550
wouldn't that be utterly humiliating?

34:43.550 --> 34:44.710
Not at all, not at all.

34:44.710 --> 34:46.230
The second allotment of funds
I'm requesting

34:46.230 --> 34:47.230
is for two things.

34:47.400 --> 34:47.800
First,

34:48.110 --> 34:50.320
to gather the finest woodblock carvers
from across the country,

34:50.320 --> 34:51.630
rebuild the academy here,

34:51.630 --> 34:53.110
and carve the "Complete Library
of the Four Treasuries."

34:53.110 --> 34:53.570
Second,

34:54.110 --> 34:55.670
to resume
the imperial examinations this year

34:55.670 --> 34:57.030
and renovate the examination halls.

34:57.030 --> 34:58.510
It's the way of civil
and martial governance—

34:58.510 --> 35:00.840
alternating
between tension and relaxation.

35:00.840 --> 35:02.110
How much money would that require?

35:02.110 --> 35:03.240
Also 100,000 taels.

35:10.350 --> 35:13.880
It's like cutting a big watermelon
in half.

35:14.190 --> 35:15.550
Half for you.

35:15.710 --> 35:17.320
Half for you.

35:17.710 --> 35:20.710
And nothing left for me.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.560
Then I'll just spread my wings.

35:23.880 --> 35:24.960
Fly away to buy another one.

35:24.960 --> 35:26.070
Mr. Liao, Mr. Chang,

35:26.070 --> 35:27.200
practicing kung fu?

35:28.110 --> 35:30.640
Let's go inside
to practice internal energy.

35:31.400 --> 35:31.870
I...

35:35.710 --> 35:36.320
Miss Liao.

35:44.840 --> 35:45.360
What, am I a ghost?

35:45.360 --> 35:47.820
All of you are running away
at the sight of me.

35:52.630 --> 35:53.280
Tell me,

35:53.550 --> 35:54.710
what on earth is going on?

35:54.710 --> 35:55.550
Why does everyone who sees me

35:55.550 --> 35:56.810
have that expression?

35:58.180 --> 35:59.280
Where do you think you're going?

35:59.280 --> 36:00.070
Tell me quickly.

36:00.070 --> 36:01.400
What exactly happened?

36:11.630 --> 36:13.360
-Mr. Gu is back!
-Mr. Gu is back!

36:13.920 --> 36:14.360
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

36:14.360 --> 36:17.360
-Good fortune and peace to you, Mr. Gu!
-Good fortune and peace to you, Mr. Gu!

36:17.360 --> 36:18.550
-Wait, why are you...
-Mr. Gu.

36:18.550 --> 36:19.070
It's me.

36:19.280 --> 36:20.320
I'm from Henian House.

36:20.320 --> 36:21.230
I'm from Taoye House!

36:21.230 --> 36:21.960
We're from Shuiming House!

36:21.960 --> 36:23.420
We're from Hongxue House!

36:23.670 --> 36:24.030
Alright.

36:24.030 --> 36:25.440
Don't touch me, don't touch me.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.070
I know you.

36:26.110 --> 36:26.910
I know you all.

36:26.930 --> 36:27.880
Why have you all gathered here

36:27.880 --> 36:28.510
to see me?

36:29.150 --> 36:30.680
No need to massage, no need.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.220
What's this all about?

36:32.430 --> 36:33.200
My good sir,

36:33.440 --> 36:34.550
why are you being

36:34.670 --> 36:35.880
so distant with us all of a sudden?

36:35.880 --> 36:36.840
-That's right!
-Exactly!

36:36.840 --> 36:38.510
The other day, you came to drink with us,

36:38.510 --> 36:39.360
enjoying yourself

36:39.360 --> 36:40.510
and telling all sorts of jokes—

36:40.510 --> 36:41.670
why are you acting so formal
all of a sudden?

36:41.670 --> 36:42.000
-Yes.
-Indeed!

36:42.000 --> 36:42.630
Don't talk nonsense!

36:42.630 --> 36:43.070
When did I

36:43.070 --> 36:43.960
tell so many jokes?

36:43.960 --> 36:44.840
Get to the point.

36:44.840 --> 36:45.480
Mr. Gu,

36:45.630 --> 36:46.670
we've come this time

36:46.670 --> 36:47.630
for just one thing.

36:47.630 --> 36:48.550
Along the Qinhuai River,

36:48.550 --> 36:49.970
hundreds of sisters

36:50.070 --> 36:51.110
sent us here as representatives

36:51.110 --> 36:52.650
to kowtow to you properly.

36:52.710 --> 36:54.360
If it weren't for you and His Excellency

36:54.360 --> 36:55.760
looking after our business

36:55.760 --> 36:57.440
and writing an elegiac couplet
for the Grande Dame,

36:57.440 --> 36:58.620
we would've all

36:58.840 --> 37:00.470
starved to death long ago.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.670
-That's right.
-Exactly.

37:01.670 --> 37:02.230
-Indeed.
-Yes.

37:02.230 --> 37:03.400
The Viceroy of Liangjiang

37:03.400 --> 37:04.760
has even allocated silver for us

37:04.760 --> 37:05.960
to repair our houses.

37:06.320 --> 37:07.130
Tomorrow,

37:07.280 --> 37:09.680
they'll start dredging the Qinhuai River!

37:11.070 --> 37:11.920
Wouldn't you say

37:11.920 --> 37:13.550
this is like being blessed
by a living Bodhisattva?

37:13.550 --> 37:15.360
-Yes.
-Indeed!

37:15.590 --> 37:17.390
-A pleasure Bodhisattva!
-Yes.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.670
-Our great benefactor!
-Indeed.

37:19.670 --> 37:20.570
When I go back,

37:20.630 --> 37:22.630
I'll set up a longevity tablet for you

37:22.630 --> 37:24.190
and place it alongside the tablet

37:24.190 --> 37:25.720
of our good sir, Guan Zhong.

37:26.070 --> 37:26.760
Come on, come on!

37:26.760 --> 37:28.300
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

37:28.550 --> 37:29.800
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, sir.

37:29.800 --> 37:30.510
Please get up, get up!

37:30.510 --> 37:31.310
Please get up!

37:31.710 --> 37:32.920
Just call him Guan Zhong.

37:32.920 --> 37:34.000
Don't say "my good sir."

37:34.000 --> 37:35.000
Address him properly.

37:35.000 --> 37:36.320
And there's no such thing
as a pleasure Bodhisattva,

37:36.320 --> 37:37.320
only living ones.

37:38.070 --> 37:39.960
Alright, you're absolutely right.

37:39.960 --> 37:40.510
We've

37:40.590 --> 37:41.500
kowtowed

37:41.710 --> 37:43.030
and will leave after saying
what we came to say.

37:43.030 --> 37:43.550
We know

37:43.710 --> 37:45.630
you're newly married.

37:45.710 --> 37:46.440
Our presence here

37:46.440 --> 37:48.500
must be inconvenient for you, right?

37:49.070 --> 37:51.360
And we know you're an honest
and upright official.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.070
Therefore,

37:52.190 --> 37:53.830
we've prepared some rouge

37:53.920 --> 37:54.800
for your wife

37:54.960 --> 37:56.780
and your mother,

37:56.880 --> 37:58.110
along with face powder

37:58.110 --> 37:59.300
and some fabric.

37:59.400 --> 38:00.770
Please don't refuse.

38:00.920 --> 38:01.930
If you refuse,

38:02.070 --> 38:03.530
you're looking down on us.

38:03.590 --> 38:05.230
-Yes, exactly.
-Yes.

38:05.710 --> 38:06.710
Don't be nervous.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.980
All 160 brothels

38:10.150 --> 38:11.740
along the Qinhuai River—

38:11.840 --> 38:13.070
the girls have all agreed

38:13.070 --> 38:16.470
to keep the back doors of the houses open
for you day and night!

38:17.710 --> 38:19.770
Even if you don't bring a single coin,

38:19.800 --> 38:22.190
we'll take care of you
for the rest of your days!

38:22.190 --> 38:25.120
-For the rest of your days!
-For the rest of your days!

38:25.550 --> 38:26.430
Alright, alright.

38:26.430 --> 38:27.710
Thank you, thank you all.

38:27.710 --> 38:28.710
Please go back now.

38:28.710 --> 38:29.790
Look, everyone,

38:29.880 --> 38:31.630
Mr. Gu hasn't been drinking,

38:31.630 --> 38:32.800
so he's being shy!

38:32.800 --> 38:33.710
-Indeed!
-Yes!

38:35.030 --> 38:37.110
It's perfectly normal
for a real man to enjoy

38:37.110 --> 38:38.440
the company of courtesans!

38:38.440 --> 38:39.900
-That's right!
-Exactly!

38:40.030 --> 38:41.190
-Do come often!
-Please come often!

38:41.190 --> 38:42.550
Remember to visit our Henian House.

38:42.550 --> 38:44.280
Come to our Taoye House!

39:13.710 --> 39:14.230
Yu'er.

39:15.630 --> 39:16.690
Doing embroidery?

39:20.760 --> 39:21.440
How did you,

39:21.440 --> 39:22.730
a woman who wields weapons,

39:22.730 --> 39:24.460
suddenly start embroidering?

39:25.550 --> 39:27.110
There's food saved for you in the kitchen.

39:27.110 --> 39:28.240
I've already eaten.

39:29.070 --> 39:30.470
I've made tea for you too.

39:31.840 --> 39:33.100
You're so thoughtful.

39:40.950 --> 39:42.370
What's this?

39:42.670 --> 39:44.130
A list of gifts sent to you.

39:44.800 --> 39:45.800
Didn't I tell you?

39:45.960 --> 39:47.110
We can't accept gifts

39:47.110 --> 39:47.840
from anyone.

39:47.880 --> 39:49.080
Why don't you listen?

39:50.800 --> 39:53.000
Mother wants you to read the gift list.

39:58.370 --> 40:02.250
[Gift List]

40:00.590 --> 40:01.670
Ten boxes of

40:01.960 --> 40:04.510
agarwood bracelets, carved with

40:04.710 --> 40:06.280
hollowed-out swastika patterns.

40:06.280 --> 40:09.820
Six gold-inlaid jade
peach-shaped hairpins.

40:10.110 --> 40:11.400
A pair of

40:11.420 --> 40:13.480
rose-tourmaline twist-pattern bracelets.

40:13.480 --> 40:15.810
One long gold-inlaid white jade hairpin.

40:15.840 --> 40:17.040
A pair of gold-inlaid

40:17.070 --> 40:19.360
spring water green jade
peach-shaped rings.

40:19.360 --> 40:20.630
One hundred...

40:22.800 --> 40:23.730
Virility Pills.

40:24.150 --> 40:25.960
These were sent by people
from the brothels, right?

40:25.960 --> 40:26.800
What kind of gift is this?

40:26.800 --> 40:29.200
Do I look like someone
who needs such pills?

40:29.400 --> 40:31.130
Finish reading the list first.

40:44.360 --> 40:45.460
Sixty pieces of

40:45.630 --> 40:47.630
erotic paintings, large and small.

40:48.070 --> 40:50.930
A complete set of
The Sexual Arts of the Bedchamber.

40:56.800 --> 40:58.730
There's no way to explain this now.

40:58.880 --> 40:59.400
Yu'er.

41:00.510 --> 41:01.960
Um, Yu'er.

41:03.070 --> 41:03.800
Yu'er!

41:04.960 --> 41:05.840
Stop embroidering.

41:05.840 --> 41:06.670
Talk to me,

41:06.880 --> 41:07.510
okay?

41:11.510 --> 41:13.480
If you're really going to

41:13.510 --> 41:15.510
deal with those officials every day

41:15.760 --> 41:17.070
while I only know how to handle weapons,

41:17.070 --> 41:18.590
ride horses, and shoot arrows,

41:18.590 --> 41:20.250
wouldn't that embarrass you?

41:20.590 --> 41:21.850
You should hire a tutor

41:21.960 --> 41:23.620
to teach me reading, writing,

41:23.840 --> 41:25.300
embroidery, and cooking,

41:25.510 --> 41:28.170
so I won't end up
being sent back to Shanxi by you.

41:29.630 --> 41:30.960
Who told you these things?

41:30.960 --> 41:32.670
Aren't they clearly trying to
drive us apart?

41:32.670 --> 41:33.510
Who said it? I'll go find them!

41:33.510 --> 41:34.960
Why are you being so fierce?

41:34.960 --> 41:35.770
I said it.

41:35.880 --> 41:36.680
What's wrong?

41:59.320 --> 42:00.960
Just keep practicing with these things.

42:00.960 --> 42:02.090
When you're with me,

42:02.280 --> 42:03.510
you don't need to
put yourself through all this.

42:03.510 --> 42:05.320
If you really want to
learn to read and write,

42:05.320 --> 42:06.180
I'll teach you.

42:06.760 --> 42:08.030
There's no one under heaven

42:08.030 --> 42:09.360
who could teach you better than I can,

42:09.360 --> 42:09.800
right?

42:15.920 --> 42:16.760
I knew it.

42:18.230 --> 42:20.190
The moment I walked in,
everyone who saw me

42:20.190 --> 42:21.920
acted like they'd seen a ghost.

42:27.630 --> 42:29.090
And you were smiling at me.

42:29.280 --> 42:29.760
Take it.

42:31.070 --> 42:32.600
I know you're angry inside.

42:33.440 --> 42:34.480
Just let it out.

42:34.590 --> 42:36.280
When you feel better, I feel better too.

42:36.280 --> 42:37.410
As husband and wife,

42:37.480 --> 42:39.610
we don't hold things in like others do.

42:45.760 --> 42:47.490
Everyone's been saying lately

42:47.630 --> 42:49.360
that you've been visiting brothels
along the Qinhuai River every day,

42:49.360 --> 42:50.690
and I didn't believe it.

42:50.960 --> 42:53.090
Of course you shouldn't believe them.

42:53.230 --> 42:54.090
Did you go then?

42:55.840 --> 42:57.150
I went for one day.

42:58.000 --> 42:58.840
If I told you

42:58.840 --> 43:00.000
that I went there on official duty,

43:00.000 --> 43:01.200
would you believe me?

43:01.360 --> 43:02.280
Would you really believe that yourself?
